# Core

- Read relevant code before editing; prefer minimal patches over broad refactors.
- Do not rename public APIs, routes, DTO fields, or Zustand state keys unless the task requires it.
- Preserve folder structure and naming inside each package.

## Packages

| Package | Stack | Default port |
|---------|-------|--------------|
| `it-viec-frontend` | React 19, Vite, TypeScript, Ant Design, Zustand, Sass | 5173 (Vite) |
| `it-viec-backend` | Spring Boot 3, Java 17 | 8081 |
| `database` | json-server mock | 3333 |

## Validation (run smallest relevant check)

- Frontend: `npm run type-check` or `npm run lint` in `it-viec-frontend`
- Backend: `./mvnw test` or targeted test class in `it-viec-backend`
- Do not modify lockfiles or generated files unless required.
